# Real keystrokes in a text box: one change event per character, and a
# button that reads what was typed.
create window into app
title of app is "Typing"
create text box into box
box has width 200
create button into read
text of read is "Read"
when box is changed
    say "now:" text of box
.
when read is clicked
    say "read:" text of box
.
put box, read in app
show app
